Edrioblastoids are a clade of elongate [[edrioasteroids]]<ref>{{harvnb|Guensburg|Blake|Sprinkle|Mooi|2016|page=257}}</ref>  Older taxonomies assigned them the rank of class (Edrioblastoidea {{small|Fay 1962}}), although they have more recently been considered an order (Edrioblastida) within the [[Edrioasteroidea]],<ref>{{Zhu|Zamora|Lefebvre|2014|page=921}}</ref> or a sub-order (Edrioblastina) within the order Edrioasterida.<ref>{{Sumrall|Heredia|Rodríguez|Mestre|2013|page=773}}</ref>

